# Author identity consolidation for git-shortlog and the GitHub
# contributors graph. Both tools apply the rules in this file when
# rendering author attribution; commits themselves are not modified.
#
# Format (see `git help mailmap`):
#   <correct-name> <correct-email> <commit-name> <commit-email>
#
# A bare `<commit-email>` form matches every commit with that email
# regardless of the commit-name, so future co-author trailers using
# the same address are caught automatically.
madpelsm <mathiasdepelsmaeker@gmail.com> <noreply@anthropic.com>
